$$  F[p] = \frac{\sinh (\sqrt{p} \alpha)}{\sinh (\sqrt{p} \beta)} 
         \frac{e^{-\gamma\sqrt{p}}}{\sqrt{p}} 
     = \sum_{n=0}^{\infty} 
     \left(
      \frac{e^{-(-\alpha+\beta+\gamma+2n\beta)\sqrt{p}}}{\sqrt{p}}
      -\frac{e^{-(\alpha+\beta+\gamma+2n\beta)\sqrt{p}}}{\sqrt{p}}
     \right)$$
