Φ(x;p;q)=\frac{1-\int_{0}^{\infty}[p(x)]^qdx}{q-1}-α \int_{0}^{\infty}p(x)dx-\beta_q \frac{\int_{0}^{\infty}x[p(x)]^qdx}{\int_{0}^{\infty}[p(x)]^qdx}
